  "description": {
    "text": "The 2019 Pokémon World Championships, held from 16 to 18 August 2019 at the Walter E. Washington Convention Center in Washington, D.C. Competitors got Champions Festival in eight languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Champion.\n\nTrophy cards, No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer, went to the top four of each age division in both the card game and the video game championships. The 2020 and 2021 World Championships were then canceled.",
